Arrows: \(a \rightarrow b\), \(a \leftarrow b\), \(a \leftarrow > b\),
\(a \mapsto b\), \(a \rightarrowtail b\), \(a \twoheadrightarrow b\).

Long arrows: \(a \longrightarrow b\), \(a \longleftarrow b\),
\(a \longleftrightarrow b\), \(a \Longrightarrow b\),
\(a \Longleftarrow b\), \(a \Longleftrightarrow b\).

Order: \(a \ll b\), \(a \lll b\), \(a \gg b\), \(a \ggg b\).

Definitions: \(a ≔ b\), \(a ::= b\), \(a ≕ b\).

Relations: \(a \neq b\), \(a \leq b\), \(a \geq b\), \(a \sim b\).

Fences: \(⟦a⟧\) and \(\left\| a \right\|\).
